1:0-88 "/// Shared game vocabularies: event types, elements, stages, quest styles, and the items" comment.line.documentation.canon
2:0-88 "/// other files pick from. Today: Server/Vocab/*.json, the define headers generated from" comment.line.documentation.canon
3:0-61 "/// them, the xmacro .inc files, and propItem.json for items." comment.line.documentation.canon
4:0-3 "///" comment.line.documentation.canon
5:0-87 "/// The important field is `EventType.param`: which kind of parameter an event's filter" comment.line.documentation.canon
6:0-88 "/// takes. Since Resource 4bb68225 (ADR-0005 d.4) it lives in Vocab/eventType.json as an" comment.line.documentation.canon
7:0-87 "/// optional `param`, and heistia_config.schema.json checks each filterParam against it" comment.line.documentation.canon
8:0-91 "/// through `x-ref-where`; the C++ EventParamHint column (EventTypeDisplay.h) still repeats" comment.line.documentation.canon
9:0-90 "/// it until Phase B. Here it is one field of one table, and every file that filters on an" comment.line.documentation.canon
10:0-89 "/// event (heistia, adventure quests, achievements...) gets the right parameter TYPE from" comment.line.documentation.canon
11:0-68 "/// it, so a wrong parameter is a type error wherever it is written." comment.line.documentation.canon
